    integration/llm/codec/internal/magpie/LICENSE.magpie.
  This is an adapted protocol-conversion source slice, not the complete Magpie
  application or a dependency on its internal application packages. Exact
  upstream paths, whole-file SHA-256 hashes, retained declarations and local
  adaptations are recorded in that directory's provenance.json. Alva owns the
  native decoder, authority/loss/size/terminal gates, HTTP transport and product
