Embedded QuickJS engine asset
  Source: QuickJS-NG v0.17.0 core, https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs
  Source archive SHA-256:
    559bc4c420475e55c7ab4510adbc562f55d7524d75e8e89d79ce4bb02f5687d9
  License: MIT; unmodified upstream copyright/permission text is preserved in
    platform/sandbox/host/scriptwasm/LICENSE.quickjs.
  Alva's bridge/host/bindings are separate project source. The rebuild uses
  QuickJS's upstream WASI stack guard without source patches and excludes quickjs-libc,
  std/os modules and the module loader. Source archive, explicit WASI SDK clang,
  exact build flags, local source hashes and binary checksum are recorded in
  platform/sandbox/host/scriptwasm/provenance.json and build.py. The WASM asset
  is rebuilt only by a maintainer; ordinary Go builds need no C/Node toolchain.
  Preserve the upstream copyright and permission notice in distributions.

